! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# Clean model: CR2 + FULL Tyr203 (His148 in MM, no CT intruder). def2-SVP.
# Directly comparable to the 44-atom (CR2+Tyr-phenol) SVP = 500.9 nm -> isolates the
# full-Tyr203-residue-vs-phenol-ring effect. Same convergence recipe; NRoots 3 (bright state).
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%pointcharges "field_chrtyr.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_chrtyr.xyz
